# Fix Plan & Task Prioritization

Task list for the project. Organized by priority. Ralph reads this file to understand what to work on next.

## Format

```markdown
## [Priority Level]

- [ ] Task description
  - Subtask 1
  - Subtask 2
```

Check off tasks as they're completed. Move completed tasks to "Completed" section.

## High Priority

These are blocking tasks that should be completed first. Each typically takes 3-4 hours.

- [ ] **User authentication system**
  - [ ] Define User and AuthToken types in shared
  - [ ] Create users table with proper schema
  - [ ] Implement AuthService with password hashing
  - [ ] Implement JWT token generation and validation
  - [ ] Create /api/auth/login endpoint
  - [ ] Create /api/auth/refresh endpoint
  - [ ] Create /api/auth/logout endpoint
  - [ ] Implement auth middleware for protected routes
  - [ ] Create login form component in frontend
  - [ ] Add auth context and useAuth hook
  - [ ] Write tests for all components (target 85%+)
  - [ ] Update documentation

  **Blocking:** Password reset, dashboard, alert system all depend on this
  **Owner:** Claude Code Agent
  **Est. Hours:** 3-4
  **Status:** Not started

- [ ] **Password reset flow**
  - [ ] Create password_reset_tokens table
  - [ ] Implement /api/auth/forgot-password endpoint
  - [ ] Implement /api/auth/reset-password endpoint
  - [ ] Send reset email (SMTP integration)
  - [ ] Create reset password form in frontend
  - [ ] Add token expiration (24-hour window)
  - [ ] Add rate limiting (1 email per 5 minutes per account)
  - [ ] Write tests

  **Blocking:** Users need way to recover lost passwords
  **Owner:** TBD
  **Est. Hours:** 2-3
  **Status:** Blocked by user auth system

- [ ] **Email verification on signup**
  - [ ] Create email_verifications table
  - [ ] Implement signup endpoint
  - [ ] Send verification email
  - [ ] Create verify email page
  - [ ] Mark users as verified after confirmation
  - [ ] Handle unverified user login (show banner, allow 3 days)
  - [ ] Write tests

  **Blocking:** Want verified emails for alerts
  **Owner:** TBD
  **Est. Hours:** 2-3
  **Status:** Blocked by user auth system

